{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$description": "Paper (paper.college) native app design tokens — Flutter (Android tablet, Windows, macOS). Source of truth for the hand-written lib/theme/paper_tokens.dart. Values are mapped 1:1 from the RPR web app (tailwind.config.ts, src/app/globals.css, design/tokens/*.json). Units: dp for sizes, ms for durations. Colors are #RRGGBB or #RRGGBBAA (CSS order; Dart uses 0xAARRGGBB).",
  "meta": {
    "name": "paper.app",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "sourceOfTruth": [
      "research-paper-helper/tailwind.config.ts (neutral hue-free gray ramp, accent family, Geist fonts)",
      "research-paper-helper/src/app/globals.css (:root + .dark CSS vars, reader mark families, motion vars)",
      "research-paper-helper/design/tokens/obsidian-sync.json + cite-add.json (success/error text, surfaces, 4px spacing)"
    ],
    "brandRules": [
      "Single accent: indigo. Everything else is hue-free neutral gray (R=G=B). Use accent only for primary actions and key interactive elements.",
      "Flat surfaces: borders + tonal steps instead of shadows (web .card = border, no shadow). Also the cheapest option for 120fps raster.",
      "The PDF page stays WHITE in both themes (web parity). Highlights multiply over the white page so glyphs stay dark.",
      "Dark accent flips to indigo-400 with DARK label ink (indigo-950); white on indigo-400 fails AA."
    ],
    "contrastGate": "Parity beats AA where the web itself is below AA. Known web pairs below AA, kept on purpose: outline #404040 on #171717 (1.73:1, input/secondary-button border), textSubtle #737373 on #171717 (3.78:1, small meta text), white on accent #818cf8 (2.98:1, CitationPopover/FigureHighlightsPanel buttons). All other text pairs pass AA; see tokens.md section 12.",
    "theme": "dark-only: the web server-renders <html class=\"dark\"> with no toggle, so color.light was removed and PaperTheme.light()/PaperColors.light alias the dark values.",
    "webParity": "Every value equals what paper.college renders (RPR tailwind.config.ts, src/app/globals.css, src/components). Full extraction, Tailwind-class table and old->new changes: design/web-parity/tokens.md."
  },
